    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "legacy",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Use Lasso",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>The Lasso tool comes handy in adding your drawings quickly to a Feed.</li>\n<li>Start by going to the main menu.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/64805fb53e2f9091.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Select Lasso",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Select Lasso from the main toolbar.</li>\n<li>If your main toolbar lacks Lasso, tap the yellow pen icon to find and enable it.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/88424a3e47d76a8e.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Use Lasso",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Encapsule what you would like to send with Lasso.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/24d0e431bbea8113.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "What to Include?",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Lasso asks you what to include.</li>\n<li>In this example we select Markers as we have already sent the shape to the target feed.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/9509cf3e03322baa.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Select Lasso Action",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Send (to Feed) is what we usually want to do. Choose that.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/4ab99bdb72063eaa.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Select Recipient",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Recipients are offered. Tap Feeds to select which feed it will be for this.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/6fa4e1cccb2792c1.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "List of Feeds",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Feeds that you have subscribed &#x26; you can write to, are listed.</li>\n<li>In this example, we have lasso'd the FRAGO3's plan drawing, so we send it to its feed.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/ae82441be003c278.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Done!",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<p>Your markers &#x26; drawings are now shared via a Feed.</p>",
          "images": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
